---
{
  title: "insert"
}
---
### NAME

    insert() - Inserts an element at a specific index.

### SYNOPSIS

    mixed insert( mixed ref *arr, mixed value, int index );

### DESCRIPTION

    Inserts an element at a specific index.

### PARAMETERS

    arr    (mixed*)
           Array to modify

    value  (mixed)
           Value to insert

    index  (int)
           Index where to insert

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) New size of array
